  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">India: Infrastructure Equity Fund - Investment in small infrastructure projects in India&apos;s poorest states</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To improve access to better quality transport, clean energy and basic urban services for households and businesses, by investing in equity to private sector-led infrastructure projects.  This will benefit an estimated 280,000 people with improved infrastructure services.</narrative>
  </description>
